Survivors report Dēvāntaka Triśiras Atikāya slain to Rāvaṇa --- Rāvaṇa faints mourning sons brothers slaughter --- Indrajit forbids grief vows to lay Rāma lifeless --- Rāvaṇa hails invincible son speeds him with blessings --- Indrajit rides to Nikumbhilā stations guards feeds fire with rites for Brahmā weapons --- Fire takes offering grants bow chariot concealment sky trembles --- Indrajit unseen rains shafts like dark cloud over monkey host --- Indrajit pierces Hanumān Sugrīva Aṅgada Jāmbavān foremost monkeys --- Rāma bids Lakṣmaṇa endure honored Brahmā weapon unresisting --- Indrajit showers Rāma Lakṣmaṇa senseless roars back into Laṅkā